                                                "sense_id": "aae06a71-1fe6-3752-9c26-3f1ff3326ed8",
                                                "text": "[…]who chained themselves to subways for the endless ride from Battery to holy Bronx on benzedrine until the noise of wheels and children brought them down[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c5b2f84-7c27-4ad3-957d-eee43d6d5087",
                                                "sense_id": "aae06a71-1fe6-3752-9c26-3f1ff3326ed8",
                                                "text": "Then I would be way ahead when college started at the end of September, and able to enjoy my last year instead of swotting away with no make-up and stringy hair, on a diet of coffee and benzedrine, the way most of the seniors taking honours did, until they finished their thesis."
                                            }
